flowchart LR
  demo_main[演示入口<br/>demo.main] -->|临时目录当 HOME| build_home[造假 ~/.claude<br/>build]
  build_home -->|写 4 个在线会话| fake_sessions[("假会话状态<br/>sessions/*.json")]
